    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Access</p>
        <h2>How joining works</h2>
        <p>Scheduled webinars use one PIN per category. Sudden interviews get a one-time room PIN created by an admin.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step reveal">
          <div class="num">1</div>
          <h3>Admin prepares the room</h3>
          <p>Admins schedule webinars by category, or open an instant interview room on the spot.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step reveal">
          <div class="num">2</div>
          <h3>You receive a PIN</h3>
          <p>Category PINs arrive from your account manager. Room PINs are shared directly by the interviewer.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step reveal">
          <div class="num">3</div>
          <h3>Enter the room</h3>
          <p>Test your camera and microphone in the lobby, then join. Webinars start muted; interviews are fully interactive.</p>
        </div>
