  <!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
  <section class="section" id="faq">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-inline:auto;text-align:center">
        <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
        <h2>Questions, answered</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq">
        <details class="reveal">
          <summary>Are the PINs different for each category?</summary>
          <p>Yes. Institutes, companies and candidates each have a separate 6-digit PIN. A PIN only unlocks webinars scheduled for that category, plus any webinar marked "All partners".</p>
        </details>
        <details class="reveal">
          <summary>How do sudden interviews work?</summary>
          <p>A Nextgenn HR administrator opens the Admin panel, fills in the interviewer, candidate and role, and the room goes live immediately with a one-time room PIN. The interviewer shares that PIN with the candidate, who joins via "Join with PIN".</p>
        </details>
        <details class="reveal">
          <summary>Can I create an instant interview room myself?</summary>
          <p>No. Instant room creation is restricted to Nextgenn HR administrators. Candidates and companies join instant rooms only with the room PIN shared by the interviewer.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="reveal">
          <summary>Do instant interview rooms appear in the public schedule?</summary>
          <p>No. Instant rooms are private and listed only in the Admin panel. Scheduled webinars and clinics appear in the public schedule for the relevant category.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="reveal">
          <summary>Who can join a webinar?</summary>
          <p>Only invited members who hold the PIN for their category. We never publish PINs on the website — they are sent by your Nextgenn HR account manager or placement cell.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="reveal">
          <summary>When does a webinar room open?</summary>
          <p>Scheduled webinar rooms unlock 15 minutes before the start time. Instant interview rooms are live the moment an admin creates them.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="reveal">
          <summary>Can I speak during a webinar?</summary>
          <p>Webinar attendees join muted by default. Use the "Raise hand" button to request the mic, and use the Q&amp;A panel to submit questions. Interviews and clinics are fully interactive.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="reveal">
          <summary>Can I join from a phone?</summary>
          <p>Yes. All rooms work in any modern mobile or desktop browser. Camera and microphone are optional — you can watch and ask questions in chat.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="reveal">
          <summary>I'm an admin — what can I manage?</summary>
          <p>From the Admin panel you can regenerate category PINs, schedule webinars and clinics, open instant interview rooms, and review or delete every session with its PIN.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

